{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在部分心理归因上比Y更强、更窄，尤其S09把“想有人陪”推进到“连那些气也肯再受”，替人物下了稍重的结论。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】把每段叙事的关键转折直接凸显出来，话与感受交替呈现，感受又随音乐进程出现，观众不必同时消化一整堆短词，更容易边听边抓住故事。它对音乐的描述也更具体，既有节奏、音型、音色和力度变化，也有这些变化引起的身体感受，情绪因此显得有层次。Y的优势是人物动机交代得略完整，尤其S05、S12的因果和心理解释；但整体上，X更容易让普通观众在有限时间里同时听懂音乐、看懂人物，并感受到前后情绪的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "335813d5-8167-4bc7-a1d9-cec76481a07b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T041028865977Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:11:55.614059+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3d4e8ab106ec2e34318ee21b2d2b5dac19983b461da1c32ed53fa5db1454a9b5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools